AB  - Math Gesture AI is a unique, artificial intelligence-based gesture recognition application that converts live hand gestures to mathematical functions. Math Gesture AI utilizes state-of-the-art machine learning frameworks such as Tensorflow and computer vision techniques from OpenCV to provide a novel way to interact with technology. It is an interactive and user-friendly platform that recognizes hand gestures for drawing, erasing, and complex math problemsolving using AI models like the Google Generative AI model. The tool is also cross platform, which means it can be used by a large variety of users. This report describes the project development, implementation and outcomes along with challenges faced and future improvements.
